# Recolour outputs and backups ------------------------------------------------
# Only figures/ (originals) and figures_fsd_sharp/ (what the site serves) are tracked.
# Any other recolour is reproducible with recolor_figures.py, and whiten_bg.py drops a
# *_cream_backup/ beside whatever it converts.
figures_fsd/
figures_fsd_tealscale/
*_cream_backup/

# Redundant renderer ----------------------------------------------------------
# The matplotlib route was overtaken by native SVG in charts.js. Kept locally in
# case a print/PNG deliverable is needed again; drop this line to track it.
rebuild_figures.py

